result: 'Added load_packages_with_ids() to packages.rs — returns (HashMap<Symbol,
  PathBuf>, HashMap<Symbol, PkgId>) by computing semantic_hash for each resolved package.
  Added dep_pkg_ids: HashMap<Symbol, PkgId> field + set_dep_pkg_ids() method to Typer.
  pipeline.rs now calls load_packages_with_ids and passes the PkgId map into the Typer.
  Resolution phase is now PackageId-aware. Zero warnings, 289 lib tests pass.'
description: Update the resolution phase to carry PackageId context, replacing reliance
  on string prefix_module identity during resolve. Done when resolution operations
  are PackageId-aware and resolve-phase tests pass with scoped identities. Depends
  on PackageId data structure and workspace flattening subtasks.
